{
  "about": "Hand-computed. madar-loyalty card::card and card::stamps: the server's rule (MadarRust loyalty/model.rs earned_and_progress and MemberRow::view, the card page's and the passes' figures; wallet/google.rs stepper, MAX_STEPS = 12, for the stamp row). Never regenerated: a change is a deliberate edit, with the working in the case's why.",
  "cards": [
    {
      "name": "fresh_member",
      "why": "a fresh card: none earned, 0 of 5, 5 to go",
      "balance": 0,
      "next_reward_cost": 5,
